title: "Lean formalization of Tutte's path and homotopy theorems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tutte formalization contributors"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proofs of Tutte's path theorem and the local BJL homotopy theorem,
  with explicit finite elementary configurations and a source-following
  counting and descent argument.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - matroid theory
  - Tutte
  - formal verification
